  "prefLabel": "Lot 700 RULES FOR EMPLOYEE RECOGNITION PROGRAM",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Lot 700 RULES FOR EMPLOYEE RECOGNITION PROGRAM\n\nStatutory Authority: 2011, 224:89\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nPursuant to 2004, 97:1-9, effective 7-10-04, the Sweepstakes Commission was renamed the Lottery Commission. The rules filed in Chapter Sw 700 by the Lottery Commission reflected the title “Sw” of the former Sweepstakes Commission. They were editorially renumbered as Chapter Lot 700 in November 2020 to indicate rules of the Lottery Commission.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot700.html"
